  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/2042326d26ec7b593e52bbbdd22d890b59b1e59f92be81a7235509e9af1c4625.png] \n\nGiven equation : 13 × 6 + 24 ÷ 6 - 17 = 91 \n\nNow, by interchanging the signs\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : ÷ and + \n\n13 × 6 + 24 ÷ 6 - 17 = 91 ⇒ 13 × **6 ÷ 24**__ + 6 - 17 = 91\n\n__**13 × **____0.25__ + 6 - 17 = 91 \n\n__**3.25 + 6**__ - 17 = 91\n\n__**9.25 - 17**__ = 91\n\n \n\n7.75 ≠ 91 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : + and × ​\n\n13 × 6 + 24 ÷ 6 - 17 = 91 ⇒ 13 + 6 × **24 ÷ 6**__ - 17 = 91\n\n13 + __**6 **____**×**____** 4**__ - 17 = 91\n\n__**13 + 24**__ - 17 = 91\n\n__**37 - 17**__ = 91\n\n20 ≠ 91 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : ÷ and × \n\n13 × 6 + 24 ÷ 6 - 17 = 91 ⇒ **13 ÷ 6**__ + 24 × 6 - 17 = 91\n\n2.16 + __**24 **____**×**____** 6**__ - 17 = 91\n\n__**2.16 + 144**__ - 17 = 91\n\n__**146.16 - 17**__ = 91\n\n129.16 ≠ 91 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : + and -\n\n13 × 6 + 24 ÷ 6 - 17 = 91 ⇒ 13 × 6 - **24 ÷ 6**__ + 17 = 91\n\n__**13 × 6**__ - 4 + 17 = 91\n\n__**78 + 17**__ - 4 = 91\n\n__**95 - 4**__ = 91\n\n**91 = 91 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nHence, \"Option - (4)\" is the correct answer.",
